.* Rendering: two list panels, views, legends, a column group, key sets.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=KINDCL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=QTYCL BASETYPE='ZONED 5 0'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=FLAGCL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=WNAME CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=WKIND CLASS=KINDCL.
:VAR NAME=WLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=WTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=WQTY CLASS=QTYCL.
:VAR NAME=ALLOWRNM CLASS=FLAGCL VALUE='Y'.
:VAR NAME=POSTO CLASS=NAMECL.
:LISTDEF NAME=WIDGETS VARS='OPT WNAME WKIND WLIB WTEXT WQTY'.
:COND NAME=CANRENAME EXPR='&ALLOWRNM. EQ "Y"'.
:COND NAME=HASWIDGETS EXPR='%LIST(WIDGETS) GT 0'.
:KEYL NAME=LISTKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11'.F11=Show quantities
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='RETURN 16' COND=HASWIDGETS.F16=Repeat position to
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION='RETURN 17'.F17=Position to
:KEYI KEY=F24 ACTION=MOREKEYS.F24=More keys
:KEYI KEY=F18 ACTION=BOTTOM.F18=Bottom
:KEYI KEY=F21 ACTION='RETURN 21' COND=CANRENAME.F21=Rename all
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=SHOWKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKWDG KEYL=LISTKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SPACE.Work with Widgets
:TOPINST.Choose an entry and press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=WIDGETS VIEWS=2 SCROLL=YES.
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='RETURN 2'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='RETURN 4'.4=Remove
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 5'.5=Show
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='RETURN 8'.8=Describe widget
:LISTACT OPTION=13 ENTER='RETURN 13'.13=Rename widget
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=WNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Widget
:LISTCOL VAR=WKIND USAGE=OUTPUT.Kind
:LISTCOL VAR=WLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=WTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:LISTCOL VAR=WQTY USAGE=OUTPUT.Quantity
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT WNAME WKIND WLIB WTEXT'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT WNAME WQTY WLIB'.
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Options or command
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=SHOWWDG KEYL=SHOWKEYS TOPSEP=SYSNAME.Show Widgets
:TOPINST.Widgets of the library, newest first.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=WIDGETS MAXHEAD=2 ACTLEN=1.
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='RETURN 1'.1=Pick
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=WNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Widget name
:LISTGRP.Location
:LISTCOL VAR=WLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=WKIND USAGE=OUTPUT.Kind
:ELISTGRP.
:LISTCOL VAR=WQTY USAGE=INPUT.On hand
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to go back.
:EPANEL.
:EPNLGRP.
